msgid "The one-shot start was claimed; includes the directory credential and public rejoin plan."
msgstr "Le démarrage unique a été réclamé ; il comprend les informations d'identification du répertoire et le plan de réintégration publique."

msgid "The order software is applied in when the agent reconciles this host: this host's own entries first, then each group's. The action comes from this host if it sets one, else from the first group that sets one, else from the package."
